# The device hardware test reports below were generated into docs/<device>/ by
# the TestReport harness (tests/ao_shaping/utils/test_report.py) and stay there:
# they are per-device acceptance records, regenerated by `pytest <device>_report`
# with the hardware marker, so their location is tied to the harness default and
# to tests/ao_shaping/test_conventions.py's tracked-docs guard.
#
# Everything under report/ that used to be listed here moved with the tree; these
# rules had to move too, or the artefacts would have been silently untracked
# by paths that no longer exist. (The miicam_simulation pair was dropped on
# 2026-10-22: that simulated report was replaced by the auto-exposure probe
# report, whose figure and artefacts are tracked on purpose so the report's
# relative links resolve in a clean clone.)
report/slm_pib_online*
# report/pearson_gifs/*.gif is deliberately NOT ignored: those 10 GIFs (~69 MB) are
# the animated record of the Pearson-correlation runs and are the only visual
# evidence for the `1 - Pearson` objective verdict, so they are reviewed in CI.
report/shape_trials/device_abba_diagnosis*
docs/beam_shaping*
docs/wfs/images/001_simulated_wfs.png
docs/wfs/wfs_report.md

