# Machine-local tool/config dirs: untracked 2026-10-19, kept on dev machines.
# .vscode (IDE config), .claude/.codegraph (AI agent configs), .slim (agent
# work logs), .streamlit (local runtime config), .auto_doc_review (doc-review
# poller state), _scripts (one-off scratch scripts).
#
# NOTE: .github is intentionally NOT ignored — the CI quality gate
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml) must live in version control. It was removed from
# VCS on 2026-10-19 (see the /github/ ignore added that day) and restored on
# 2026-10-21 per maintainer instruction.
/.vscode/
/.claude/
/.codegraph/
/.slim/
/.streamlit/
/.auto_doc_review/
/_scripts/
/.workbuddy/
